    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">360‑Degree Digital Condition Audit</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Before the vehicle leaves the depot, capture high‑resolution photos and video from every angle. Upload the media to a secure cloud folder shared with the transport company. This audit serves as a pre‑loading record that can be referenced if any damage occurs en route.</p>
