    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Battery Terminal Checks &amp; FASTag Management</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Inspect battery terminals for corrosion and secure them with terminal covers. For electric vehicles, confirm the battery is fully charged. For fuel‑powered cars, verify the FASTag is active and linked to the correct account to avoid toll penalties.</p>
