    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">One‑Quarter Tank Fuel Regulation</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Fill the tank to exactly 25% capacity to prevent over‑pressure in the fuel lines during transport. This standard is recognized across Indian transport regulations and is a common requirement in reviews of movers from Hyderabad to Delhi.</p>
